results/codex/codex_data_v2_verify3.md:3:**Final decision: NO-GO for both LFM3-VL-2B and Qwen3.5-2B on `836e401958a62a25171f8a7bf7b1ec91727a6b6c`, at the requested v1 budget of 1,250 × 32 = 40,000 row presentations.** Two conversion defects remain: the new submit classifier deletes non-submit actions and retains their dependent observations; the scroll converter accepts clock-hand and text-selection-handle drags that the unchanged executor cannot represent faithfully. These are demonstrated in published examples, separately from the small amount of residual source-label noise in the random review. The latter would not, by itself, justify rejecting this SFT experiment.
results/codex/codex_data_v2_verify3.md:5:Audited dataset: [experimentalmachines/AndroidAgent-SFT-v2 at the immutable DATA revision](https://huggingface.co/datasets/experimentalmachines/AndroidAgent-SFT-v2/tree/836e401958a62a25171f8a7bf7b1ec91727a6b6c). Baseline: [second report](codex_data_v2_verify.md). Inspected `git diff e336f6d~1 -- data/build_v2_mix.py` and the current files, including the revision-3 header. Local HEAD was `325e78f6cd8ec70cedeeca41467c0bd9664cdce3`; the audited builder SHA-256 is `b1ba0583113c116c41811ea492ba0a59ed5fbc1a9acaf79361e611501ea35199`. No builder, trainer, job definition or dataset was changed, and no training/device run was launched.
results/codex/codex_data_v2_verify3.md:20:The downloaded stats equal `results/data_v2/stats.json` byte for byte. All four source-stage final log objects match their stats; no build log has a traceback. The full action counters total **81,357**, exactly the declared train/dev population. Those counters are **builder-side evidence**, not an independent examination of the other twelve train shards. Hub HEAD `2840951ea23475ba7db49bb11c00ec42361760d0` differs from the pin only in README; all data and stats blob identities agree. The README at the DATA pin still has revision-2 prose, so the updated local card was also inspected. Its Odyssey scroll-cutoff count says 1,282, while stats/logs say 1,279; this documentation discrepancy does not affect the decision. [Download manifest](data_v2_cache/verify3_836e401958/download_manifest.json), [Hub inventory](data_v2_cache/verify3_836e401958/inventory.json), [build/log/input-hash evidence](data_v2_cache/verify3_836e401958/build_evidence.json).
