 reference application configuration, replayable browser\ntraces, a behavioral verifier, and a reference solution.\nThe release contains 4,063 feature-restoration tasks across 26… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/microsoft/ProgramDistill.","downloads":3061,"tags":["task_categories:text-generation","language:en","license:mit","size_categories:1K<n<10K","library:harbor","arxiv:2609.18805","region:us","code","software-engineering","coding-agents","web-agents","web-applications","harbor","browser-agents","benchmark","executable-evaluation"],"createdAt":"2026-09-24T14:01:23.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6ae0d980824a8eff167660f3","id":"microsoft/SynthDocQA","author":"microsoft","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-11-05T17:18:42.000Z","likes":6,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"d7dc206a40e9f0371f32319a0fb5d1e18f433fc1","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSynthDocQA\n\t\n\nA benchmark dataset for evaluating document understanding and question-answering systems on complex, realistic synthetic business documents.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nSynthDocQA contains 9,798 questions grounded in 100 synthetic PDF documents spanning diverse business domains and document types. Each question is tied to a specific element in a document (table, figure, form, annotation, or text block) and comes with structured assertions defining the expected answer.\nThe… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/microsoft/SynthDocQA.","downloads":1754,"tags":["task_categories:question-answering","task_categories:document-question-answering","language:en","license:cdla-permissive-2.0","size_categories:1K<n<10K","modality:document","region:us","document-understanding","synthetic","pdf","tables","forms","figures","annotations","rag","benchmark"],"createdAt":"2026-10-27T17:04:00.000Z","key":""}]
