# GUI Reflection SFT Training Data


This is the GUI Reflection offline SFT data.  
The image of this data should be downloaded from 
[AITW](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/android_in_the_wild), 
[AITZ](https://github.com/IMNearth/CoAT).
[AndroidControl](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/android_control), 
[GUI_Odyssey](https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenGVLab/GUI-Odyssey), 
[AMEX](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Yuxiang007/AMEX).  



