## Running
| What | Where | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Qwen3.5-0.8B training (resumed from step 1200) → evals | Colab **G4** (RTX PRO 6000 96 GB), main account | 1.8 s/step (L4 was 18 s/step); done ≈ 13:30 |
